# Naming: nxt and MOS-nxt

## Product and DWC plugin id: `nxt`

- Firmware / operations system name: **`nxt`** (lowercase).
- **`plugin.json` → `id`** and **`dwcWebpackChunk`**: **`nxt`**
- DWC dev tree: **`DuetWebControl/src/plugins/nxt`** (directory name must match `id`)
- Routes: **`/nxt`**, **`/nxt/ToolLibrary`**
- **`registerPluginData('nxt', …)`**; store: **`plugins.get('nxt')`**
- Built assets: **`dwc/js/nxt.<hash>.js`**, **`dwc/css/nxt.<hash>.css`**
- **`dwc-plugins.json`** top-level key: **`nxt`**
- Main component: **`ui/src/nxt.vue`**

## Repository: `MOS-nxt`

- Checkout folder: **`MOS-nxt/`** next to **`DuetWebControl/`**
- **URL:** `https://github.com/MillenniumMachines/MOS-nxt` (releases under `/releases`)

## i18n

- Locale bundle id: **`nxt`** via `registerPluginLocalization('nxt', …)`.
- Template keys: **`plugins.nxt.*`** (must match plugin `id`).

## Release / SD

- Plugin ZIP: **`nxt-<version>.zip`**
- Macros on SD: **`nxt.g`**, **`nxt-config/`**, **`global.nxt*`**

## Before merge (plugin id / paths)

Run from repo root:

```bash
./dist/audit-naming.sh
./dist/verify-nxt-plugin-contract.mjs
```

See [docs/NAMING.md](../../docs/NAMING.md).
